WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 23]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:01.110 --> 02:02.140
Xumi Realm?

02:02.140 --> 02:03.100
[Xumi Realm]

02:14.100 --> 02:17.500
[Xumi Realm]

02:33.830 --> 02:34.500
Could this

02:35.320 --> 02:36.850
be a morning glory seed?

03:28.830 --> 03:30.180
"Ding Qiansui colluded with the Japanese.

03:31.360 --> 03:32.900
The jar is the core of the magic.

03:33.430 --> 03:34.810
It will bring mortal danger.

03:36.590 --> 03:38.810
Go deeper. I'll be waiting.

03:39.830 --> 03:40.690
The seed is important.

03:43.160 --> 03:44.860
You must trust yourself."

03:46.240 --> 03:48.220
Am I supposed to grow this seed?

05:04.680 --> 05:05.210
Master.

05:05.880 --> 05:06.940
It's solid rock behind this wall.

05:07.350 --> 05:08.180
There's no passage.

05:08.760 --> 05:10.940
This place ends here.

05:12.200 --> 05:14.620
They say fish water nourishes, and rice water makes things thrive.

05:15.520 --> 05:17.010
Could we be using the wrong water?

05:18.000 --> 05:18.980
That makes sense.

05:19.680 --> 05:20.500
But Laogou,

05:20.910 --> 05:22.330
that's for growing crops.

05:23.000 --> 05:24.250
We're growing a tower here.

05:24.680 --> 05:25.570
It's different.

05:28.680 --> 05:29.370
Then what kind

05:29.390 --> 05:30.330
of water do we need?

05:34.960 --> 05:35.370
Tiezui.

05:36.150 --> 05:36.740
Give me your hand.

05:38.230 --> 05:38.660
What for?

05:42.230 --> 05:43.740
That hurts, Laogou!

05:46.470 --> 05:47.450
Are you mad?

05:47.520 --> 05:48.130
Let's try it.

05:48.560 --> 05:49.810
That's how it always goes in stories.

05:52.440 --> 05:53.370
Good heavens.

06:59.340 --> 07:00.460
[Otherworld Tower]

08:16.320 --> 08:17.130
We really

08:17.440 --> 08:18.500
grew a tower.

08:19.440 --> 08:20.570
Told you miracles happen.

08:45.320 --> 08:46.330
Not a speck of dust.

08:47.040 --> 08:48.330
Could a visual trick be this convincing?

08:49.040 --> 08:49.850
It looks freshly built.

08:50.560 --> 08:51.450
It just grew.

08:52.110 --> 08:52.970
Of course it's new.

08:53.680 --> 08:54.940
Good thing you brought me down here.

08:55.590 --> 08:56.420
Otherwise, this tower

08:57.080 --> 08:58.330
might never have been grown.

09:01.990 --> 09:02.610
Zhang Qishan,

09:03.510 --> 09:04.380
do you believe me now?

09:04.990 --> 09:05.540
Fine.

09:06.350 --> 09:07.450
We'll say you were right.

09:08.800 --> 09:09.380
Master Zhang.

09:24.470 --> 09:25.140
You all heard that?

09:26.590 --> 09:27.140
Yes.

09:28.160 --> 09:28.810
Do you think

09:29.350 --> 09:30.420
the tower might be

09:30.470 --> 09:31.490
shrinking back?

09:32.110 --> 09:33.210
Then we'd better run.

09:33.470 --> 09:34.140
Otherwise,

09:34.350 --> 09:35.660
we'll be crushed to death.

09:56.350 --> 09:56.730
Master Zhang,

09:57.470 --> 09:58.420
there's space behind this wall.

10:36.280 --> 10:36.810
Master Zhang.

10:38.630 --> 10:39.730
Master Zhang, look.

10:44.960 --> 10:46.300
Isn't this the corridor

10:46.920 --> 10:48.260
in the great ghost palace

10:48.280 --> 10:49.090
Yin Changsheng built?

10:50.630 --> 10:51.060
But...

10:52.990 --> 10:54.180
But the location is wrong.

10:54.470 --> 10:55.140
The two corridors

10:55.400 --> 10:56.380
shouldn't be next to each other.

10:57.160 --> 10:58.090
The tower is still growing.

11:00.990 --> 11:01.490
Xiaoyu,

11:02.320 --> 11:03.090
smash through this wall too.

11:26.830 --> 11:27.420
Master Zhang,

11:28.280 --> 11:29.090
why are we back

11:29.110 --> 11:30.060
in the Otherworld Hall?

11:30.060 --> 11:30.780
[Otherworld Tower]

11:31.750 --> 11:32.900
This isn't the same place.

11:34.590 --> 11:35.210
Right.

11:38.560 --> 11:40.090
The incantation on the wall is gone too.

11:45.680 --> 11:46.140
Tiezui.

11:47.680 --> 11:49.060
Recite that spell

11:49.830 --> 11:50.810
for growing the tower again.

11:51.320 --> 11:52.210
Tower Cultivation:

11:52.960 --> 11:54.420
"Though no path seems to lie ahead,

11:55.200 --> 11:56.540
it simply has yet to be grown.

11:57.400 --> 11:58.420
Plant the magical seed.

11:59.080 --> 12:00.060
Let water and fire unite,

12:01.040 --> 12:02.420
and 100 towers shall rise,

12:03.230 --> 12:04.180
with 1,000 gates opening.

12:04.470 --> 12:04.900
The towers

12:05.400 --> 12:06.420
will grow by themselves."

12:07.560 --> 12:08.180
I understand now.

12:09.350 --> 12:10.380
The hundred towers mentioned

12:10.870 --> 12:12.260
aren't an exaggeration.

12:12.590 --> 12:13.610
It literally means 100 towers.

12:16.470 --> 12:16.940
We

12:18.160 --> 12:19.300
grew 100 towers.

12:21.460 --> 12:26.580
[Otherworld Tower]

13:43.750 --> 13:45.090
Laogou, Tiezui!

13:52.800 --> 13:53.330
Master,

13:54.110 --> 13:55.570
doesn't that look like Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

13:57.440 --> 13:58.610
That's Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

13:59.680 --> 14:00.660
Who painted this?

14:01.750 --> 14:02.810
Why is it here?

14:03.320 --> 14:04.810
The style is Japanese.

14:05.710 --> 14:07.570
The Japanese must have painted it themselves.

14:08.510 --> 14:09.140
Master Zhang,

14:10.200 --> 14:11.450
there's a reason

14:11.990 --> 14:13.490
this was painted here.

14:15.440 --> 14:16.210
Do you remember

14:16.710 --> 14:17.210
one

14:17.230 --> 14:18.260
of the spells we saw before

14:18.510 --> 14:19.810
called Spirit Communion?

14:19.810 --> 14:23.300
[Spirit Communion]

14:24.630 --> 14:25.090
Look.

14:25.990 --> 14:27.140
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's right hand

14:27.800 --> 14:28.850
forms the Heavenly Master Seal,

14:29.320 --> 14:30.660
and his left forms the Earth Gate Seal.

14:31.230 --> 14:32.490
Together, they mean to connect

14:32.870 --> 14:33.810
heaven and earth.

14:34.160 --> 14:35.420
That's a gesture for spirit communion.

14:36.400 --> 14:37.210
And this mural

14:37.350 --> 14:38.380
was painted

14:38.440 --> 14:39.490
right at the central Taiji point,

14:39.830 --> 14:41.420
where the entire tower's energy

14:41.560 --> 14:42.970
converges.

14:44.110 --> 14:45.140
So this mural

14:45.630 --> 14:47.090
isn't really a mural at all.

14:47.750 --> 14:49.060
It's Hatoyama performing a ritual.

14:50.440 --> 14:51.330
He's using

14:51.350 --> 14:52.780
Spirit Communion to communicate

14:53.280 --> 14:54.060
with this tower,

14:54.560 --> 14:55.210
or rather,

14:55.470 --> 14:56.490
with whatever

14:56.510 --> 14:57.380
these hundred towers

14:58.200 --> 14:59.090
have grown into.

15:02.920 --> 15:04.330
He's communicating with this tower?

15:05.830 --> 15:07.490
Could he be learning spells from it?

15:08.280 --> 15:09.780
There's no point speculating too much now.

15:10.470 --> 15:11.660
Catching him is what matters most.

15:12.800 --> 15:14.180
Since Hatoyama left this mural here,

15:14.680 --> 15:16.420
he must have been here.

15:17.280 --> 15:18.180
We'll start from here

15:18.590 --> 15:20.060
and follow his trail.

15:21.470 --> 15:22.090
All right.

15:52.590 --> 15:54.300
You finally came.

16:00.560 --> 16:01.660
You left this for me,

16:02.920 --> 16:03.380
didn't you?

16:05.870 --> 16:06.900
So you

16:07.200 --> 16:08.330
do believe

16:08.350 --> 16:10.420
the clues I left you.

16:14.780 --> 16:17.580
[The jar is the core of the magic. It will bring mortal danger.]

16:19.040 --> 16:19.660
You said this jar

16:19.680 --> 16:21.020
would bring mortal danger,

16:21.920 --> 16:23.610
so I gave it to Ding Qiansui

16:24.400 --> 16:25.610
to see if he'd die.

16:32.200 --> 16:33.900
Now that Ding Qiansui is dead,

16:35.200 --> 16:35.970
that means

16:36.920 --> 16:38.060
there's some truth

16:38.400 --> 16:39.450
to this note.

16:40.830 --> 16:41.900
Good girl.

16:42.710 --> 16:43.330
Look.

16:44.320 --> 16:46.540
By following the clues I left you,

16:47.960 --> 16:49.140
you managed

16:49.920 --> 16:51.850
to grow this tower, didn't you?

16:57.990 --> 16:58.940
This isn't the truth.

17:00.400 --> 17:01.210
Come.

17:03.590 --> 17:05.050
Go deeper.

17:07.680 --> 17:08.940
I'll be waiting.

17:11.070 --> 17:11.940
Why did you

17:11.960 --> 17:12.900
lead me here?

17:13.840 --> 17:14.900
I want you

17:16.680 --> 17:18.900
to remember everything.

17:26.300 --> 17:27.880
[Go deeper. I'll be waiting.]

17:27.880 --> 17:29.460
[You must trust yourself.]

18:20.030 --> 18:20.450
Master,

18:21.070 --> 18:21.690
it seems the Japanese

18:21.710 --> 18:22.490
really were here.

18:28.840 --> 18:29.380
Master.

18:48.510 --> 18:48.970
Master,

18:49.550 --> 18:50.970
another crossfire position.

18:52.070 --> 18:52.900
What's that smell?

18:53.310 --> 18:54.010
It reeks

18:54.920 --> 18:55.730
of corpses.

19:00.750 --> 19:01.180
Xiaoyu,

19:01.990 --> 19:02.690
come in with me.

19:03.310 --> 19:03.820
You two

19:04.710 --> 19:05.210
stay here.

19:07.070 --> 19:08.250
Tiezui and I stay here?

19:13.960 --> 19:14.420
Fine.

19:14.790 --> 19:15.620
Be careful.

19:22.470 --> 19:23.290
Search over there.

20:03.120 --> 20:03.530
Master,

20:04.470 --> 20:05.690
why are there so many Zhainiangniang?

20:06.510 --> 20:07.860
They smell so bad.

20:08.920 --> 20:09.660
Can you smell it?

20:14.750 --> 20:15.340
I...

20:34.200 --> 20:35.100
They're from Unit 401.

20:35.440 --> 20:35.900
Stop.

20:39.310 --> 20:40.420
Something's wrong up ahead.

20:53.750 --> 20:54.860
There are only two possibilities.

20:55.960 --> 20:56.340
One,

20:57.270 --> 20:58.050
the fog is poisonous.

20:59.710 --> 21:00.100
Two,

21:02.550 --> 21:04.140
where they lie is extremely dangerous.

21:04.880 --> 21:06.380
Going over there could get us killed.

21:08.070 --> 21:09.440
The Japanese always make a point

21:09.440 --> 21:10.600
of laying their war dead to rest.

21:11.230 --> 21:12.470
With so many Japanese soldiers

21:12.470 --> 21:13.210
lying here,

21:14.120 --> 21:15.250
there's only one reason

21:16.120 --> 21:17.100
their bodies weren't recovered:

21:20.750 --> 21:22.050
they couldn't recover them.

21:53.400 --> 21:53.900
Tiezui!

21:55.510 --> 21:56.010
Tiezui!

22:00.920 --> 22:01.420
Hurry up.

22:02.790 --> 22:03.210
Read this.

22:03.990 --> 22:04.660
What does it say?

22:04.840 --> 22:05.820
Read what?

22:05.920 --> 22:06.860
Now you need me?

22:06.890 --> 22:07.860
Come on, hurry.

22:12.550 --> 22:13.660
It's all in Japanese.

22:13.660 --> 22:14.730
How am I supposed to read it?

22:15.360 --> 22:16.380
If we'd known,

22:16.550 --> 22:17.180
we should've had

22:17.200 --> 22:18.140
Master Zhang bring Xiaojin down.

22:20.750 --> 22:21.770
Now look at us.

22:22.120 --> 22:23.050
The four of us

22:23.440 --> 22:24.290
can't read a single word

22:24.310 --> 22:25.250
of this Japanese.

22:25.510 --> 22:26.180
Just take a look.

22:28.180 --> 22:29.500
[Zhang Jiale, Zhang Lifu, Zhang Shun, Zhang Zufeng, Zhang Xiaolei]

22:30.310 --> 22:31.690
Names from Unit 401?

22:37.200 --> 22:38.010
Strange.

22:38.880 --> 22:39.860
But why

22:40.200 --> 22:41.730
are all these names circled?

22:42.550 --> 22:43.210
What?

22:45.580 --> 22:47.700
[Zhang Jing, Gou, Zhang Kun]

22:48.880 --> 22:49.770
Gou?

22:51.380 --> 22:53.100
[Gou]

22:53.710 --> 22:55.290
Why does this drawing

22:55.360 --> 22:56.580
look so familiar?

22:57.750 --> 22:59.450
Why do I feel like I drew it?

22:59.750 --> 23:01.250
Because you did draw it.

23:01.710 --> 23:02.660
Who else could it be?

23:03.070 --> 23:04.050
Who signs their name

23:04.070 --> 23:05.180
like that?

23:08.790 --> 23:09.690
I can't remember.

23:11.160 --> 23:12.730
If you wrote this "Gou,"

23:14.030 --> 23:15.290
could the names before it have been

23:15.880 --> 23:17.380
written by Unit 401 soldiers themselves?

23:18.880 --> 23:20.900
Why are there no more circles

23:22.680 --> 23:24.620
after this "Gou" character?

23:25.470 --> 23:25.970
And

23:26.680 --> 23:27.140
look.

23:27.990 --> 23:29.210
Only your "Gou"

23:29.840 --> 23:30.940
keeps appearing.

23:31.600 --> 23:33.140
The other names show up only now and then.

23:34.750 --> 23:35.290
Could

23:36.310 --> 23:37.500
your signature have

23:37.500 --> 23:38.530
some special meaning?

23:39.360 --> 23:40.290
Think carefully.

23:43.550 --> 23:44.380
I can't remember.

23:45.030 --> 23:46.310
Try harder.

23:46.400 --> 23:47.210
Look. Your signature

23:47.840 --> 23:48.770
is all over this.

23:49.940 --> 23:51.200
[Gou]

23:51.200 --> 23:51.940
Remember now?

23:52.400 --> 23:54.010
Why is my name there?

23:56.000 --> 23:56.450
Well...

23:56.470 --> 23:57.660
I really can't remember.

24:00.470 --> 24:00.940
Master Zhang.

24:01.360 --> 24:01.820
How did it go?

24:02.470 --> 24:03.580
We couldn't get past a spot ahead.

24:03.750 --> 24:04.620
It was strewn with bodies.

24:04.920 --> 24:05.530
Some were Japanese.

24:05.840 --> 24:06.620
Some were from Unit 401.

24:07.200 --> 24:08.340
And it was full of Zhainiangniang.

24:11.160 --> 24:11.660
Master Zhang,

24:12.230 --> 24:13.210
we found

24:13.270 --> 24:13.900
this booklet.

24:14.360 --> 24:15.050
Inside

24:16.030 --> 24:17.820
are signatures from Laogou and Unit 401.

24:22.540 --> 24:23.340
[Gou]

24:28.540 --> 24:30.940
[Gou]

24:33.360 --> 24:34.340
Based on what

24:34.360 --> 24:35.490
Xiaoyu and I found inside,

24:36.160 --> 24:37.340
we should be able to work it out.

24:38.680 --> 24:40.380
"The structure ahead is the only passage.

24:41.070 --> 24:42.900
Toxic gas hangs in the central section.

24:44.920 --> 24:46.620
Even with protective suits,

24:46.990 --> 24:48.250
passage may still be impossible."

24:54.070 --> 24:55.340
Our judgment was right.

24:59.200 --> 25:00.340
"Zhainiangniang."

25:01.360 --> 25:02.380
"The Zhainiangniang contain

25:02.400 --> 25:03.730
a special protein

25:04.710 --> 25:05.620
that neutralizes the poison."

25:07.400 --> 25:08.860
No wonder the Zhainiangniang inside

25:08.920 --> 25:09.690
are still alive.

25:10.960 --> 25:11.660
What does that mean?

25:13.920 --> 25:15.010
Could it be

25:16.200 --> 25:17.900
that you tamed the Zhainiangniang,

25:19.310 --> 25:21.140
and the Japanese used them

25:21.880 --> 25:23.940
to find a way through the toxic gas?

25:29.200 --> 25:30.660
Now I understand.

25:30.790 --> 25:31.290
So,

25:32.200 --> 25:33.180
before Laogou arrived,

25:33.400 --> 25:34.050
the people

25:34.070 --> 25:35.450
whose names were circled

25:36.510 --> 25:37.860
were probably already dead.

25:38.710 --> 25:39.820
After Laogou arrived,

25:40.550 --> 25:42.250
the names stopped being circled

25:42.600 --> 25:43.340
because

25:44.230 --> 25:46.900
he had tamed the Zhainiangniang

25:47.400 --> 25:48.180
and led those people

25:48.880 --> 25:50.250
safely through.

25:53.750 --> 25:54.620
You mean

25:55.750 --> 25:56.900
I helped the Japanese?

25:59.920 --> 26:01.100
Yes, that's what I mean.

26:04.120 --> 26:04.620
Laogou,

26:06.360 --> 26:07.660
I need you to focus.

26:08.750 --> 26:09.450
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

26:09.470 --> 26:10.820
may have gone deeper inside.

26:11.360 --> 26:12.380
We have to catch up.

26:13.200 --> 26:13.770
Only you.

26:14.990 --> 26:16.100
Only you can get us

26:16.160 --> 26:17.210
through that area.

26:36.230 --> 26:36.770
Master Zhang,

26:36.990 --> 26:37.770
how did this place end up

26:37.840 --> 26:38.660
like this?

26:39.070 --> 26:39.820
Can you remember

26:39.880 --> 26:41.100
how you tamed the Zhainiangniang?

27:01.680 --> 27:02.290
Stay still.

27:19.160 --> 27:20.490
Then I have to try something.

27:22.440 --> 27:23.290
What?

27:25.880 --> 27:27.660
I'll lure a Zhainiangniang over

27:28.640 --> 27:30.180
and see if it jogs your memory.

27:31.070 --> 27:31.770
But everyone

27:32.230 --> 27:33.180
needs to be prepared.

27:33.990 --> 27:34.740
If I can't

27:34.740 --> 27:35.660
subdue it in one move,

27:36.600 --> 27:37.340
I'll alert

27:37.400 --> 27:38.490
every Zhainiangniang here.

27:41.360 --> 27:41.900
Xiaoyu,

27:43.230 --> 27:44.250
if things go wrong,

27:45.710 --> 27:46.580
follow my orders

27:47.070 --> 27:48.820
and take Laogou and Tiezui back.

27:48.990 --> 27:49.940
Don't look back no matter what.

27:50.310 --> 27:50.860
Master Zhang...

27:51.470 --> 27:51.940
Yes.

27:54.470 --> 27:55.100
Laogou, come on.

27:55.550 --> 27:56.290
Stand back.

27:56.710 --> 27:57.140
Come on.

27:57.470 --> 27:57.940
Back here.

27:57.960 --> 27:59.010
I can't remember.

28:27.710 --> 28:28.250
Laogou,

28:28.880 --> 28:29.660
watch carefully.

28:35.470 --> 28:36.690
Fifth Master, try to remember.

28:38.310 --> 28:38.860
That's right.

28:38.990 --> 28:40.660
There's no time. Think!

28:40.710 --> 28:42.010
Can you tame it?

28:56.840 --> 28:57.380
Laogou!

30:43.360 --> 30:43.900
It's alive.

30:47.960 --> 30:48.580
Be careful.

30:48.880 --> 30:49.770
Keep moving.

31:18.600 --> 31:19.730
Japanese military boot prints.

31:26.510 --> 31:27.100
Master Zhang,

31:27.680 --> 31:28.680
we should get out

31:28.680 --> 31:29.560
of here.

31:32.550 --> 31:33.420
Keep moving.

31:34.790 --> 31:35.380
All right.

31:47.920 --> 31:48.530
Laogou!

31:48.840 --> 31:49.450
Come on.

32:00.550 --> 32:01.100
Master Zhang,

32:01.440 --> 32:02.100
we really should

32:02.120 --> 32:03.100
get out of here.

32:03.600 --> 32:04.530
It's too dangerous,

32:04.840 --> 32:06.100
especially with Laogou like this.

32:06.600 --> 32:07.140
Master Zhang,

32:07.200 --> 32:08.210
don't wait until...

32:16.880 --> 32:18.180
Good heavens.

32:18.640 --> 32:19.690
It's enormous.

32:22.360 --> 32:22.940
Master Zhang,

32:23.400 --> 32:24.860
that's no ordinary Zhainiangniang.

32:25.600 --> 32:27.420
That's practically their Queen Mother!

32:29.160 --> 32:29.900
Keep moving.

33:52.710 --> 33:53.690
Another tower.

33:55.710 --> 33:57.140
The towers really are growing out of order.

34:04.600 --> 34:05.580
Towers within towers,

34:06.310 --> 34:07.530
perils within perils,

34:08.280 --> 34:09.700
beyond all mortal measure.

34:10.550 --> 34:11.490
Behind each gate lies no gate.

34:11.920 --> 34:12.820
Behind each shadow lies another.

34:13.440 --> 34:14.820
That is the truth of this place.

34:15.670 --> 34:17.220
The Otherworld Tower is infinite.

34:26.800 --> 34:27.340
Look.

34:30.360 --> 34:31.340
Is that a human eye?

34:32.360 --> 34:33.340
Why is it here?

34:34.360 --> 34:35.220
This carving

34:35.510 --> 34:36.730
never appeared

34:36.730 --> 34:37.490
in the Otherworld Tower in Changsha.

34:38.590 --> 34:39.740
Everyone, stay on your guard.

34:40.990 --> 34:41.530
All right.

34:52.240 --> 34:52.740
This way.

35:10.320 --> 35:11.320
This is just like the entrance

35:11.320 --> 35:12.860
to the stage back in Changsha's Otherworld Tower.

35:17.990 --> 35:18.820
Look at these footprints.

35:19.550 --> 35:20.380
Don't they look

35:20.400 --> 35:21.780
like Japanese military boot prints?

35:23.470 --> 35:24.420
The footprints go

35:24.470 --> 35:25.300
in and out repeatedly.

35:25.760 --> 35:26.380
Looks like they

35:26.400 --> 35:27.380
stayed here for quite a while.

35:28.360 --> 35:28.780
Master Zhang,

35:29.880 --> 35:30.530
this place

35:30.960 --> 35:32.260
must have been important

35:32.280 --> 35:32.970
to the Japanese.

35:33.470 --> 35:34.130
Let's go in.

35:34.550 --> 35:34.970
All right.

36:04.190 --> 36:04.740
What?

36:05.150 --> 36:06.220
Instead of Madam Wang,

36:07.630 --> 36:09.050
the Japanese are putting on the show here?

37:06.660 --> 37:07.820
[Pills of eternal youth and immortality]

37:08.240 --> 37:09.900
"Pills of eternal youth and immortality"?

37:13.280 --> 37:13.780
Tiezui.

37:14.990 --> 37:15.650
This is your field.

37:15.990 --> 37:16.570
Come take a look.

37:26.960 --> 37:27.650
Ritual implements.

37:30.110 --> 37:30.820
Talismans.

37:32.110 --> 37:33.050
Bamboo slips.

37:36.360 --> 37:36.860
Master Zhang,

37:38.470 --> 37:39.490
these are spell manuals

37:39.510 --> 37:40.450
left by Yin Changsheng.

37:40.800 --> 37:41.420
Hatoyama

37:42.360 --> 37:43.940
actually found this place.

37:44.510 --> 37:45.130
Read the slips.

37:46.510 --> 37:46.970
All right.

37:54.510 --> 37:55.610
"Walk the Dipper steps.

37:56.990 --> 37:58.260
Let Ren and Hai converge.

37:59.470 --> 38:01.090
Combine three qian of cinnabar,

38:01.960 --> 38:03.090
one qian of a child's blood,

38:04.150 --> 38:06.130
and half a qian of hanshui deer-antler shavings.

38:06.920 --> 38:08.520
Refine until red-gold,

38:08.590 --> 38:09.900
then swallow with warm wine.

38:10.840 --> 38:12.940
Youth will return,

38:13.280 --> 38:14.260
and no poison can harm you."

38:16.470 --> 38:16.970
Master Zhang,

38:17.320 --> 38:17.650
this...

38:19.070 --> 38:20.650
this is the Danqi Revival Art.

38:30.110 --> 38:31.090
"Twenty-nine years old.

38:31.510 --> 38:32.130
Male.

38:32.990 --> 38:33.700
Test subject.

38:34.880 --> 38:35.740
Full-body convulsions

38:36.590 --> 38:37.740
after administration.

38:38.510 --> 38:39.970
Body temperature: 52 degrees.

38:40.590 --> 38:41.570
Skin turned bluish-purple.

38:43.550 --> 38:44.380
Showed signs of poisoning.

38:45.800 --> 38:47.700
Heartbeat stopped after 16 minutes."

38:49.400 --> 38:50.740
Looks like Hatoyama

38:51.840 --> 38:52.610
was

38:52.800 --> 38:53.970
conducting experiments

38:54.670 --> 38:55.650
according to the ancient texts.

38:56.550 --> 38:57.090
Could he

38:57.990 --> 38:59.340
be trying to become an immortal?

39:00.590 --> 39:01.300
This isn't cultivation.

39:01.550 --> 39:02.170
It's refining life itself.

39:02.960 --> 39:03.740
They're using us as fuel

39:03.770 --> 39:04.570
to prolong their lives.

39:08.800 --> 39:10.530
He wasn't just studying spells.

39:11.760 --> 39:13.220
He used people as test subjects.

39:14.880 --> 39:15.650
A lot of people died.

39:18.280 --> 39:19.010
Come look!

39:38.720 --> 39:39.490
Why are these all

39:39.510 --> 39:40.420
Japanese corpses?

39:41.280 --> 39:42.420
Strange.

39:43.400 --> 39:44.820
How did their bodies

39:45.510 --> 39:46.860
end up like this?

40:13.190 --> 40:15.940
"KGX0601."

40:16.670 --> 40:17.820
I never thought Hatoyama

40:18.440 --> 40:20.970
would use Japanese as test subjects.

40:21.550 --> 40:22.650
That's strange.

40:23.670 --> 40:24.740
The Japanese

40:25.280 --> 40:26.870
already captured Unit 401.

40:27.280 --> 40:28.650
Why would they risk their own men's lives

40:28.650 --> 40:29.360
for these experiments?

40:33.110 --> 40:33.650
Xiaoyu.

40:35.190 --> 40:36.570
Check every body.

40:38.630 --> 40:39.860
See if you can find any clues

40:40.360 --> 40:41.490
about Hatoyama or Unit 401.

40:41.630 --> 40:42.130
Yes.

40:56.990 --> 40:57.490
Master Zhang,

40:58.240 --> 40:59.610
no bodies from Unit 401 were found.

41:00.150 --> 41:01.380
Hatoyama isn't among them either.

41:04.030 --> 41:05.570
This log lists nearly 100 people.

41:07.070 --> 41:08.050
Besides the Japanese

41:08.050 --> 41:08.900
in Changsha,

41:09.800 --> 41:11.260
they must've also sent reinforcements

41:11.550 --> 41:12.340
to Caopan Mountain.

41:13.920 --> 41:14.970
Then where did they go?

41:16.800 --> 41:18.130
Judging by this place,

41:19.800 --> 41:22.130
could they all be dead?

41:23.150 --> 41:23.740
Look.

41:27.240 --> 41:28.900
This log isn't complete.

41:29.920 --> 41:31.820
It ends with just this:

41:32.880 --> 41:34.420
"I have attained an immortal body

41:34.840 --> 41:37.260
and become one with this tower.

41:37.670 --> 41:39.380
I am the Otherworld Tower.

41:40.800 --> 41:41.450
The Otherworld Tower

41:42.800 --> 41:44.530
is me."

41:46.280 --> 41:47.010
Could

41:47.630 --> 41:48.970
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama have mastered

41:48.990 --> 41:50.260
all the spells,

41:50.280 --> 41:51.300
become an immortal,

41:52.720 --> 41:53.860
and merged

41:53.880 --> 41:55.090
with the Otherworld Tower?

41:56.960 --> 41:57.740
Immortal, my foot.

41:58.590 --> 41:59.610
You expect us to believe that?

42:01.070 --> 42:02.530
He's probably hiding somewhere,

42:02.800 --> 42:04.340
waiting to play dirty and scare us.

42:05.030 --> 42:05.900
If even Hatoyama's soldiers

42:05.920 --> 42:06.530
are dead,

42:06.920 --> 42:07.700
then Unit 401

42:07.840 --> 42:08.900
may have met the same fate.

42:10.240 --> 42:12.450
We have to find them, dead or alive.

42:12.990 --> 42:13.610
Keep searching.

42:43.760 --> 42:45.380
Such a terrible drawing.

42:46.760 --> 42:47.860
You must've drawn it, right?

42:50.880 --> 42:51.610
This dog

42:51.880 --> 42:53.260
was definitely drawn by Laogou.

42:53.360 --> 42:53.970
But Master Zhang,

42:54.920 --> 42:56.010
Laogou can't remember...

42:56.150 --> 42:56.650
This way.

44:04.720 --> 44:06.450
This place looks freshly grown.

44:41.780 --> 44:45.940
♪The past fades like smoke♪

44:46.300 --> 44:49.020
♪A choice is made in silence♪

44:49.300 --> 44:52.100
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

44:52.500 --> 44:56.260
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

44:56.500 --> 44:59.940
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

45:00.220 --> 45:03.620
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

45:03.700 --> 45:10.980
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

45:11.420 --> 45:14.700
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

45:14.980 --> 45:18.220
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

45:18.380 --> 45:22.420
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

45:22.620 --> 45:25.980
♪Who believes in fate?♪

45:26.220 --> 45:29.580
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

45:29.820 --> 45:33.100
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

45:33.420 --> 45:37.100
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

45:37.300 --> 45:40.540
♪Take care♪

45:40.540 --> 45:43.100
♪We once raced♪

45:43.180 --> 45:45.100
♪For the dawn♪

45:45.260 --> 45:48.540
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

45:48.660 --> 45:51.940
♪In the web of fate♪

45:51.940 --> 45:55.140
♪No one can escape♪

45:56.140 --> 45:57.980
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

45:58.140 --> 45:59.700
♪We too were young once♪

45:59.780 --> 46:03.220
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

46:03.420 --> 46:05.740
♪Keep the ember lit♪

46:05.860 --> 46:10.380
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

46:10.500 --> 46:13.460
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

46:13.700 --> 46:17.220
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

46:17.340 --> 46:21.100
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

46:21.420 --> 46:24.900
♪Who believes in fate?♪

46:25.060 --> 46:28.060
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

46:28.300 --> 46:32.060
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

46:32.220 --> 46:35.940
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

46:36.060 --> 46:47.500
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
